<noinclude>
This template places a location dot and optional label on the Burawa map.

Usage:
{{Burawa location
| x = 300
| y = 200
| label = City Name
| label_position = top
}}

XY coordinates are relative to the top-left corner of the map (when scaled to 1000px width).
</noinclude><includeonly>{{Location mark
| image = Burawa location map.svg
| width = {{{width|300}}}
| mark = Red pog.svg
| marksize = 6
| x = {{{x|}}}
| y = {{{y|}}}
| label = {{{label|}}}
| label_position = {{{label_position|top}}}
| background = transparent
}}</includeonly>